Penile skin and prepuce = superficial inguinal lymph nodes Glans penis and penile urethra=deep inguinal lymph nodes(recall)

Scrotum=Superficial inguinal lymph nodes (RECALL)

Testes= lumber or para-aortic lymph nodes (RECALL)

prostate= internal iliac nodes (recall)

High Yield:

