Abdominal oesophagus Stomach Pancreas(recall)

Liver Spleen Gallbladder Duodenum proximal to major duodenal papilla

2. Superior mesenteric group of preaortic lymph nodes drain:

distal duodenum Jejunum Ileum Cecum Appendix Ascending colon Proximal two third of transverse colon

3. 3. Inferior mesenteric group of preaortic lymph: Distal transverse colon Descending colon Sigmoid colon Proximal rectum

Lumbar or Paraaortic lymph nodes:

Kidney (Recall)

Adrenal gland Testes (recall)

Ovaries (recall)

