Urea (>7 mmol/L)

Respiratory rate (2 30/min)

Blood pressure (< 90 systolic or $ 60 diastolic) 65 (age >= 65

Risk

Score 0 to 1 low risk Score 2: Intermediate risk Score 3 to 5: High risk

