A 45-year-old woman who has recently undergone surgery to remove a tumor located near her parotid gland. The surgery was successful, but she has been experiencing post-operative discomfort and numbness in the area around her ear, particularly in her ear lobule and along her jawline. Which one of the following nerves is likely affected?

