Diaphragm: Normal quiet inspiration Normal expiration: Passive recoil of lungs Inspiration: External intercostal muscle Expiration: Internal intercostal muscle Accessory muscle of inspiration: Sternocleidomastoid Accessory muscle of expiration: Transversus abdominal muscles Forced expiration: Internal intercostal muscle an d rectus abdominus (RECALL)

